    - target: {fileID: 899811820591855403, guid: 0b62242a110afa34499a4d135aa6d7e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Rotating the circle doesn\u2019t create a new arrangement.\n\nWith
        A fixed, the two valid arrangements are ABC and ACB.\n\nThis can be represented
        with the formula of P = (n-1)!\n\nWe are subtracting to 1 to fix an item
        and find the arrangments of the rest of the items."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
